WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.560
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:02.065 --> 00:00:05.230
Growing up, I was always
the littlest guy on my team.

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.294
Even now, I think I still am.

00:00:08.294 --> 00:00:10.604
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:12.914 --> 00:00:15.234
You don't listen to what
anybody says you can't do,

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:19.402
because you know that you can.

00:00:20.902 --> 00:00:22.296
You ready?

00:00:22.296 --> 00:00:24.110
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:24.188 --> 00:00:25.607
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:25.607 --> 00:00:27.499
[CHEERING]

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.510
Being able to shoot
is all about becoming

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.947
a more complete and
confident ball-handler.

00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:36.300
"Curry, putting on a
dribbling clinic."

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.090
To maximize the quickest
release possible for you,

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:40.920
lock in on the
path that the ball

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.010
takes from your
catch-ready position

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.330
to your final release point.

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:46.880
So that's how you can shoot
the same from whether it's

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:50.670
in the paint all the way out to
the deep 3 area and knock it down.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:52.098
[CHEERING]

00:00:53.042 --> 00:00:54.750
When you catch and
you're ready to shoot,

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.060
I look where the rim
and the net meet.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:59.670
Put that basketball
right on those hooks.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:00.900
And that's what I lock in on.

00:01:03.882 --> 00:01:05.373
"Curry splits the defense."

00:01:05.373 --> 00:01:07.858
"Behind the back, fires a three."

00:01:07.858 --> 00:01:09.350
"Oh, and he puts it in!"

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:10.970
Stop it right there.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:11.550
Rewind it.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:15.270
My defender has clearly
established his lead foot.

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:18.420
Make him open his whole body,
and create a driving angle.

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:20.130
I have all the control,
all the leverage

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:21.129
in the world right here.

00:01:21.129 --> 00:01:22.663
Look at Ian
travel, though.

00:01:22.663 --> 00:01:23.589
Good gracious.

00:01:23.589 --> 00:01:25.241
[LAUGHTER]

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:27.870
When we overload
ourselves in the workout

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:30.405
with two basketballs
or a tennis ball,

00:01:30.405 --> 00:01:32.910
it makes the game
seem a lot slower.

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:35.218
And you're able to process
things a lot better.

00:01:35.818 --> 00:01:37.175
[GROAN]

00:01:37.175 --> 00:01:38.558
That's why we're
here, to get better.

00:01:38.758 --> 00:01:40.750
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:42.665
It might be tough.

00:01:42.665 --> 00:01:45.290
You might have to overcome a lot
more than the guy next to you,

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:47.370
but that's what makes
it all worth it.

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.540
No matter where you are
in your progression,

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:51.770
we're all in the same boat.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:53.450
I'm still searching
for perfection

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:55.430
and the full potential
in this game.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:57.590
The time is now for you
to start your journey

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:59.670
to find ways to get better.

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:00.810
That's why we're all here.

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:03.040
You need to get in the
gym and get to work.

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:04.825
Time's ticking.

00:02:04.825 --> 00:02:06.700
I'm Stephen Curry.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.763
And this is my MasterClass.

